  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 6 * 12 * 3 * 8 * 3 * 35\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) +, –, ×, ÷, = \n\n6 * 12 * 3 * 8 * 3 * 35 ⇒ 6 + 12 - 3 × 8 ÷ 3 = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + 12 - 3 × __**8 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + 12 - __**3 **____**× 2.67**__ = 35\n\n⇒ __**6 + 12**__ - 8 = 35\n\n⇒ __**18 - 8**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 10 ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\n6 * 12 * 3 * 8 * 3 * 35 ⇒ 6 ÷ 12 - 3 × 8 + 3 = 35\n\n⇒ __**6 ÷**____** 12**__ - 3 × 8 + 3 = 35\n\n⇒ 0.5 - __**3 **____**×**____** 8**__ + 3 = 35\n\n⇒ __**0.5**____** + 3**__ - 24 = 35\n\n⇒ __3.5____** - 24**__ = 35\n\n⇒ -20.5 ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ÷, ×, –, = \n\n6 * 12 * 3 * 8 * 3 * 35 ⇒ 6 + 12 ÷ 3 × 8 - 3 = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + __**12 **____**÷**____** 3**__ × 8 - 3 = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + __**4**____** ×**____** 8**__ - 3 = 35\n\n⇒ __**6 + 32**__ - 3 = 35\n\n⇒ __38____** - 3**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 35 = **35** (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\n6 * 12 * 3 * 8 * 3 * 35 ⇒ 6 + 12 × 3 - 8 ÷ 3 = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + 12 × 3 - __**8 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 6 + __**12 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 2.67 = 35\n\n⇒ __**6 + 36**__ - 2.67 = 35\n\n⇒ __42____** - 2.67**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 39.33 ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
